DAY 5 - SWITCHING

CISCO SWITCHING PROTOCOLS
- 802.1q - trunking (switch to switch)
- 802.1d - spanning tree protocol (stp)
- 802.1w - rapid spanning tree protocol (rstp)
- 802.1s - multiple spanning tree protocol (mst) 
- 802.1x - port security 

STATES OF SWITCHES - STP
LIS - listening 15 secs (AMBER color switch)
LRN - learning 15 secs (AMBER color switch)
FWD - forwarding (GREEN color switch)

